// Signing.xcconfig — the only file you need to edit to run Maple on your iPhone.
//
// 1. Xcode → Settings → Accounts → add your Apple ID.
// 2. Paste your Team ID below (Xcode shows it next to the team name).
// 3. Leave MAPLE_TIER = free until you join the paid Apple Developer Program.
//    `paid` turns on Family Controls (app blocking) and iCloud, which free teams can't provision.
//
// The Simulator needs none of this.

DEVELOPMENT_TEAM =
MAPLE_TIER = free
